#: flowview_filters.php
msgid "Materialization pre-computes the results of a Filter for each flow partition, with NAT on and off, and stores them in the Parallel Query cache, so reports over older data open quickly.  New partitions are materialized automatically once they stop receiving flows.  Required means partitions that have rotated are not materialized yet, Running means a materialization is in progress, and Up to date means every rotated partition is materialized.  Running: N is how many queries of the Filter are working now.  The partition still receiving flows is not materialized, so it does not count."
msgstr "Materialisering voorbereken die resultate van 'n Filter vir elke vloeipartisie, met NAT aan en af, en stoor dit in die Parallelle Navraag-kasgeheue sodat verslae oor ouer data vinnig oopmaak.  Nuwe partisies word outomaties gematerialiseer sodra hulle ophou om vloeie te ontvang.  Vereis beteken partisies wat geroteer het, is nog nie gematerialiseer nie, Loop tans beteken 'n materialisering is aan die gang, en Op datum beteken elke geroteerde partisie is gematerialiseer.  Loop tans: N dui aan hoeveel navrae van die Filter tans werk.  Die partisie wat steeds vloeie ontvang, word nie gematerialiseer nie, dus tel dit nie."

