#: setup.php
msgid "Local IP Range"
msgstr "Plaaslike IP-reeks"

#: setup.php
msgid "Provide the IPv4 ip address range for your local network for hosts that may not be registered in DNS.  These hosts will be mapped to the Local Domain Name above.  This more for home users.  You can use either CIDR or non-CIDR formats.  For example: 192.168.11.0 or 192.168.11.0/24"
msgstr "Verskaf die IPv4-IP-adresreeks vir jou plaaslike netwerk vir Gashere wat dalk nie in DNS geregistreer is nie. Hierdie Gashere sal aan die plaaslike domeinnaam hierbo gekoppel word. Dit is meer vir tuisgebruikers. Jy kan óf CIDR- óf nie-CIDR-formate gebruik. Byvoorbeeld: 192.168.11.0 of 192.168.11.0/24"

#: setup.php
msgid "Use CIDR or Non-CIDR"
msgstr "Gebruik CIDR of Nie-CIDR"

#: setup.php
msgid "Use Arin to find Domains and AS Numbers"
msgstr "Gebruik ARIN om domeine en AS-nommers te vind"

#: setup.php
msgid "Many Big Tech data collection services like to mask their ownership of domains to obfuscate the fact that they are collecting your personal information.  If you are concerned with this and your Cacti install has access to the Internet, you can use Arin to remove the mask from those Big Tech companies."
msgstr "Baie groot tegnologiemaatskappye se data-insamelingsdienste hou daarvan om hul eienaarskap van domeine te verbloem om die feit te verdoesel dat hulle jou persoonlike inligting insamel. As jy hieroor bekommerd is en jou Cacti-installasie toegang tot die internet het, kan jy Arin gebruik om die masker van daardie groot tegnologiemaatskappye te verwyder."

