#: setup.php
msgid "Parallel Queries"
msgstr "Parallelle navrae"

#: setup.php
msgid "Parallel Query Backend"
msgstr "Parallelle navraag-agterkant"

#: setup.php
msgid "Choose how parallel FlowView queries are executed.  The Legacy PHP Runner forks the flowview_runner.php process per query and shard.  The FlowView Query Service dispatches the same map-reduce work to a long-running Go service over localhost, avoiding per-query process startup and database polling latency.  Requires the flowview-query service (see plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) to be installed and running."
msgstr "Kies hoe parallelle FlowView-navrae uitgevoer word.  Die Verouderde PHP-loper vurk die flowview_runner.php-proses per navraag en skerf.  Die FlowView-navraagdiens stuur dieselfde map-reduce-werk na 'n langlopende Go-diens oor localhost, wat proses-opstart per navraag en databasispeiling-latensie vermy.  Vereis dat die flowview-query-diens (sien plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) geïnstalleer en aktief is."

#: setup.php
msgid "Legacy PHP Runner"
msgstr "Verouderde PHP-uitvoerder"

#: setup.php
msgid "FlowView Query Service"
msgstr "FlowView-navraagdiens"

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service URL"
msgstr "Navraagdiens-URL"

#: setup.php
msgid "Base URL of the FlowView Query Service, for example http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Leave blank to auto-discover the ephemeral port from the service's port file."
msgstr "Basis-URL van die FlowView-navraagdiens, byvoorbeeld http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Laat leeg om die efemere poort outomaties vanaf die diens se poortlêer te ontdek."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Port File"
msgstr "Navraagdiens-poortlêer"

#: setup.php
msgid "Path to the port file the FlowView Query Service writes its bound address to.  Used to discover the service endpoint when the Query Service URL above is blank."
msgstr "Pad na die poortlêer waarna die FlowView-navraagdiens sy gebonde adres skryf. Word gebruik om die dienseindpunt te ontdek wanneer die Navraagdiens-URL hierbo leeg is."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Token"
msgstr "Navraagdiens-token"

#: setup.php
msgid "Optional shared secret.  When set, Cacti sends it to the FlowView Query Service as an \"Authorization: Bearer\" header and the service rejects any state-changing request that does not present the same token.  Set the matching value in the service's config file (auth_token) or the FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN environment variable.  Recommended whenever the service is reachable by anything other than trusted local processes."
msgstr "Opsionele gedeelde geheim.  Wanneer dit gestel is, stuur Cacti dit aan die FlowView-navraagdiens as 'n \"Authorization: Bearer\"-opskrif en die diens verwerp enige staatveranderende versoek wat nie dieselfde teken aanbied nie.  Stel die ooreenstemmende waarde in die diens se konfigurasielêer (auth_token) of die FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN-omgewingsveranderlike.  Aanbeveel wanneer die diens bereikbaar is deur enigiets anders as vertroude plaaslike prosesse."

#: setup.php
msgid "Max Concurrent Threads"
msgstr "Maks. gelyktydige drade"

#: setup.php
msgid "The maximum number of threads that will be dispatched to run the FlowView queries.  Note that you can have at most 1 thread per database partition, and you should be careful not to overload your database server with having too many concurrent threads running."
msgstr "Die maksimum aantal drade wat uitgestuur sal word om die FlowView-navrae uit te voer. Let daarop dat jy hoogstens 1 draad per databasispartisie kan hê, en jy moet versigtig wees om nie jou databasisbediener te oorlaai deur te veel gelyktydige drade te laat loop nie."

